  "prologue": "«📖 Opening Quote\n\"Some betrayals don't begin with hatred.\n\nThey begin with comparison.\"»\n\n---\n\nNo one wakes up one morning and decides to destroy a friendship.\n\nSometimes...\n\nIt begins with a passing comment.\n\nA single comparison.\n\nA moment of applause meant for someone else.\n\nA smile that slowly becomes harder to fake.\n\nFrom the outside...\n\nFriendship looks unbreakable.\n\nShared laughter.\n\nLate-night conversations.\n\nDreams whispered beneath quiet skies.\n\nPromises to always stand together.\n\nBut not every wound leaves a scar the world can see.\n\nSome grow silently.\n\nHidden behind kind words.\n\nHidden behind applause.\n\nHidden...\n\nBehind a smile.\n\nThis is not only a story about betrayal.\n\nIt is a story about friendship.\n\nAbout jealousy that was never spoken aloud.\n\nAbout the quiet weight of comparison.\n\nAbout choices...\n\nAnd the consequences they leave behind.\n\nMost of all...\n\nIt is a story about truth.\n\nBecause no matter how carefully a lie is planned...\n\nNo matter how deeply it is buried...\n\nThe truth has a way of finding the light.\n\nSo before you turn the page...\n\nAsk yourself one question.\n\nHow well do you really know the people who stand beside you every day?\n\nSometimes...\n\nThe person who smiles the brightest...\n\nIs hiding the darkest secret.\n\n---\n\nThe story begins...",
