      "number": 1,
      "title": "New Beginnings",
      "content": "📖 Opening Quote\n\"Every story begins with hope. No one ever sees the chapter where everything changes.\"\n\nThe first rays of sunlight stretched across Westbridge University.\n\nStudents hurried through the gates with backpacks slung over their shoulders, their laughter\nechoing across the beautiful campus.\n\nSome were running late for lectures.\n\nOthers stopped to greet old friends after the long holiday.\n\nIt was the beginning of a new academic year.\n\nFor many...\n\nIt was just another semester.\n\nFor Ariana Cole...\n\nIt felt like the beginning of the future she had always dreamed of.\n\nAriana stepped through the university gates with a smile on her face.\n\nShe took a deep breath.\n\n\"I'll do my best this year.\"\n\nHer mother had said those same words before she left home that morning.\n\n\"Work hard.\"\n\n\"Be kind.\"\n\n\"And never lose yourself trying to please the world.\"\n\nAriana smiled at the memory.\n\nHer mother always knew exactly what to say.\n\nAs she crossed the courtyard, a familiar voice called out.\n\n\"Ariana!\"\n\nShe turned around.\n\nLena came running toward her with a wide smile.\n\n\"You actually made it before the first lecture!\"\n\nAriana laughed.\n\n\"I didn't want to start the semester by being late.\"\n\nLena pretended to look shocked.\n\n\"Who are you, and what have you done with my best friend?\"\n\nThe two girls laughed together.\n\nLena linked her arm with Ariana's.\n\n\"I missed you.\"\n\n\"I missed you too.\"\n\nThe lecture hall slowly filled with students.\n\nProfessor Adams walked to the front of the room.\n\nHe looked around with a warm smile.\n\n\"Welcome back, everyone.\"\n\n\"I hope you all had a restful holiday.\"\n\nA chorus of greetings filled the room.\n\nProfessor Adams nodded.\n\n\"This year will challenge you.\"\n\n\"It will test your discipline...\"\n\n\"Your patience...\"\n\n\"And your character.\"\n\nHe paused for a moment.\n\n\"But I believe each of you has the potential to succeed.\"\n\nAriana listened carefully.\n\nShe loved lectures like this.\n\nThey reminded her why she had chosen Westbridge University.\n\nAfter class...\n\nStudents spilled into the courtyard.\n\nMarcus waved enthusiastically from across the path.\n\n\"There you are!\"\n\nLena laughed.\n\n\"I thought you'd gotten lost already.\"\n\nMarcus grinned.\n\n\"I was looking for food.\"\n\n\"You are always looking for food,\" Ariana teased.\n\n\"It's an important life skill.\"\n\nThe three friends laughed as they walked toward the campus café.\n\nAs they reached the entrance...\n\nSomeone gently tapped Ariana's shoulder.\n\nShe turned.\n\nChloe stood there with a bright smile.\n\n\"There you are.\"\n\n\"I've been looking everywhere.\"\n\nWithout waiting for an answer...\n\nChloe pulled Ariana into a warm hug.\n\n\"Welcome back.\"\n\nAriana hugged her just as tightly.\n\n\"I missed you.\"\n\n\"I missed you more.\"\n\nMarcus pretended to wipe away a tear.\n\n\"This is beautiful.\"\n\nLena nudged him.\n\n\"Don't ruin the moment.\"\n\nEveryone laughed.\n\nA few minutes later...\n\nAnother familiar face appeared.\n\nEthan.\n\nHe adjusted the strap of his backpack before smiling at the group.\n\n\"So...\"\n\n\"Did I miss anything?\"\n\nMarcus folded his arms dramatically.\n\n\"Only an emotional reunion.\"\n\nEthan chuckled.\n\n\"I came just in time then.\"\n\nThe five friends walked toward the café together.\n\nStudents greeted them as they passed.\n\n\"They're all back together.\"\n\n\"The Circle of Five.\"\n\n\"They haven't changed at all.\"\n\nAriana smiled.\n\nShe looked at her friends one by one.\n\nLena.\n\nMarcus.\n\nChloe.\n\nEthan.\n\nThey weren't just classmates.\n\nThey were the people who had turned university into a second home.\n\nShe silently hoped...\n\nNo matter what happened in the future...\n\nThey would always stay this close.\n\nShe had no way of knowing...\n\nThat one promise...\n\nWould soon be tested.\n\n💭 Ending Quote\n\"The happiest beginnings often hide the saddest endings.\"   🌸"
