      "title": "Rumors",
      "content": "📖 Opening Quote\n\"Rumors don't knock before they enter. They simply arrive... and wait for someone to believe them.\"\n\nA week passed peacefully.\n\nMid-semester examinations were finally over.\n\nStudents poured out of lecture halls with relieved smiles.\n\nMarcus stretched dramatically.\n\n\"I've survived.\"\n\nLena laughed.\n\n\"You say that after every exam.\"\n\n\"Because every exam tries to kill me.\"\n\nEven Ariana couldn't stop laughing.\n\n\"You'll pass.\"\n\n\"I hope your confidence can improve my grades.\"\n\nThe five friends walked toward the campus café.\n\nAs they reached the entrance...\n\nTwo students standing nearby suddenly fell silent.\n\nOne of them whispered,\n\n\"That's her...\"\n\nThe other quickly looked away.\n\nAriana frowned.\n\n\"That's strange.\"\n\nMarcus shrugged.\n\n\"They're probably talking about someone else.\"\n\n\"Maybe.\"\n\nShe smiled and let it go.\n\nInside the café...\n\nThe group found their usual table.\n\nWhile everyone discussed the exams...\n\nAriana noticed Ethan wasn't saying much.\n\n\"You've been quiet.\"\n\n\"I'm just tired.\"\n\nMarcus smirked.\n\n\"No.\"\n\n\"He's thinking about someone.\"\n\nEthan threw a napkin at him.\n\n\"Eat your food.\"\n\nLaughter echoed around the table.\n\nFor a little while...\n\nEverything felt normal again.\n\nThat afternoon...\n\nAriana stopped by the library to return a book.\n\nAs she walked through the shelves...\n\nShe heard two students talking.\n\n\"I heard Professor Adams is looking for someone.\"\n\n\"They said important research documents went missing.\"\n\n\"Really?\"\n\n\"Yeah.\"\n\n\"I wonder who took them.\"\n\nAriana didn't think much of it.\n\nUniversities handled missing documents all the time.\n\nShe placed the book on the return desk and left.\n\nOutside...\n\nChloe was waiting for her.\n\n\"There you are.\"\n\n\"I've been looking everywhere.\"\n\nAriana smiled.\n\n\"Sorry. I had to return a book.\"\n\nChloe linked her arm with Ariana's.\n\n\"Come on.\"\n\n\"The others are waiting.\"\n\nThe two friends walked away, chatting about weekend plans.\n\nNeither of them knew...\n\nThat the missing research documents would soon change both of their lives forever.\n\nThat evening...\n\nThe group chat buzzed with messages.\n\nMarcus: Who's free this Saturday? Football or movie?\n\nLena: Movie!\n\nEthan: Movie.\n\nChloe: Movie sounds good.\n\nAriana smiled and typed,\n\nAriana: Only if Marcus promises not to spoil the ending this time.   😂\nWithin seconds...\n\nMarcus replied,\n\nNo promises.\n\nThe conversation filled with laughing emojis.\n\nAriana put her phone aside.\n\nShe had no idea...\n\nThese simple conversations would one day become memories she wished she could relive.\n\nAcross campus...\n\nProfessor Adams stood alone in his office.\n\nHe looked at an empty drawer.\n\nHis expression grew serious.\n\n\"The research file...\"\n\n\"It has to be somewhere.\"\n\nHe picked up the office phone.\n\n\"Please ask campus security to review yesterday's recordings.\"\n\nOutside...\n\nRain began to fall.\n\nSoftly.\n\nQuietly.\n\nAs if the storm was only beginning.\n\n💭 Ending Quote\n\"Every storm begins with a single cloud that no one thinks to fear.\"   🌧️"
