      "number": 15,
      "title": "Under the Spotlight",
      "content": "📖 Opening Quote\n\"Sometimes it isn't the truth that destroys a person... it's the suspicion.\"\n\nMonday morning...\n\nWestbridge University was quieter than usual.\n\nAs Ariana walked across the courtyard...\n\nShe felt eyes following her.\n\nSome students greeted her as always.\n\nOthers simply stared.\n\nThe whispers had become impossible to ignore.\n\nInside the lecture hall...\n\nProfessor Adams entered with a pile of examination papers.\n\n\"Before we begin today's lecture...\"\n\n\"I have an announcement.\"\n\nThe room fell silent.\n\n\"The investigation into the missing research documents is still ongoing.\"\n\n\"I ask everyone to cooperate with campus security.\"\n\n\"And please...\"\n\n\"Do not spread rumors.\"\n\n\"They hurt innocent people.\"\n\nSeveral students lowered their heads.\n\nAriana quietly looked at her notebook.\n\nShe appreciated his words.\n\nBut they couldn't erase the damage that had already been done.\n\nAfter class...\n\nMarcus caught up with her.\n\n\"Come on.\"\n\n\"We're getting lunch.\"\n\n\"I'm not hungry.\"\n\n\"You don't have a choice.\"\n\nLena smiled.\n\n\"If you don't eat...\"\n\n\"Marcus will eat your food.\"\n\nMarcus looked offended.\n\n\"I would never...\"\n\nEveryone stared at him.\n\n\"...Okay.\"\n\n\"I probably would.\"\n\nFor the first time in days...\n\nAriana laughed.\n\nA real laugh.\n\nEven if it only lasted a few seconds.\n\nLater that afternoon...\n\nDaniel requested another meeting with Ariana.\n\nThis time...\n\nHe wasn't alone.\n\nA digital forensics specialist sat beside him.\n\nDaniel placed Ariana's student ID card on the table.\n\n\"We've confirmed something important.\"\n\nAriana looked at him nervously.\n\n\"What is it?\"\n\n\"The access log wasn't created using your physical card.\"\n\nShe frowned.\n\n\"I don't understand.\"\n\nThe specialist spoke gently.\n\n\"Someone copied your student ID information.\"\n\n\"It's possible to clone the data from a card if they have access to it.\"\n\nAriana's eyes widened.\n\n\"So...\"\n\n\"Someone used my identity?\"\n\nDaniel nodded.\n\n\"That's what we're beginning to believe.\"\n\nFor the first time since the investigation began...\n\nAriana felt a small spark of hope.\n\nSomeone finally believed she might be telling the truth.\n\nOutside the administration building...\n\nThe Circle of Five waited.\n\nThe moment Ariana stepped outside...\n\nThey rushed toward her.\n\n\"What happened?\" Ethan asked.\n\nAriana smiled for the first time in what felt like forever.\n\n\"They think my ID was cloned.\"\n\nMarcus blinked.\n\n\"So...\"\n\n\"You've been telling the truth all along.\"\n\nAriana laughed softly.\n\n\"I've always been telling the truth.\"\n\nMarcus rubbed the back of his neck.\n\n\"I know.\"\n\n\"I just meant...\"\n\nBefore he could finish...\n\nAriana smiled.\n\n\"I know what you meant.\"\n\nChloe stepped forward and hugged her tightly.\n\n\"I told you.\"\n\n\"The truth would find its way.\"\n\nAriana hugged her back.\n\n\"Thank you for never giving up on me.\"\n\nLena smiled as tears filled her eyes.\n\n\"We're going to get through this.\"\n\nTogether.\n\nThat evening...\n\nDaniel remained alone in his office.\n\nHe pinned a new photograph onto the investigation board.\n\nAriana's cloned student ID.\n\nHe stepped back.\n\nSomeone had planned this carefully.\n\nThis wasn't a random theft.\n\nIt wasn't a prank.\n\nIt was a trap.\n\nAnd whoever built it...\n\nHad known Ariana for a long time.\n\nDaniel looked at the board one last time.\n\nThen quietly said,\n\n\"This case...\"\n\n\"...is much bigger than I first imagined.\"\n\n💭 Ending Quote\n\"The most dangerous traps are the ones built by someone who already knows your every step.\"   🖤"
