      "number": 17,
      "title": "When Trust Is Tested",
      "content": "📖 Opening Quote\n\"Trust isn't only tested by lies. Sometimes it's tested by silence.\"\n\nThree days passed.\n\nThe investigation seemed to have reached another dead end.\n\nNo new evidence.\n\nNo arrests.\n\nNo answers.\n\nBut the rumors...\n\nRefused to disappear.\n\nThe university cafeteria was unusually crowded during lunch.\n\nAs Ariana and her friends searched for an empty table...\n\nA loud voice echoed across the room.\n\n\"That's her.\"\n\nSeveral students turned.\n\nWithin seconds...\n\nThe whispers began again.\n\n\"I heard she's still under investigation.\"\n\n\"They say security is protecting her.\"\n\n\"I wonder what really happened.\"\n\nAriana lowered her eyes.\n\nShe pretended not to hear.\n\nMarcus looked around angrily.\n\n\"Do these people ever stop talking?\"\n\nLena sighed.\n\n\"Probably not.\"\n\nChloe gently touched Ariana's arm.\n\n\"Come on.\"\n\n\"Let's eat somewhere else.\"\n\nAriana nodded quietly.\n\n\"Okay.\"\n\nThe five friends found a bench beneath the old oak tree.\n\nFor the first time...\n\nNo one joked.\n\nNo one laughed.\n\nThe silence felt heavier than words.\n\nFinally...\n\nMarcus spoke.\n\n\"I miss how things used to be.\"\n\nLena smiled sadly.\n\n\"So do I.\"\n\nEthan looked at Ariana.\n\n\"We'll get through this.\"\n\nShe looked down at the sandwich in her hands.\n\n\"I hope so.\"\n\nThat evening...\n\nDaniel sat alone in the security office.\n\nThe investigation board had grown larger.\n\nPhotographs.\n\nSecurity logs.\n\nAccess records.\n\nWitness statements.\n\nYet one question remained unanswered.\n\nWhy Ariana?\n\nHe looked at her academic records.\n\nExcellent grades.\n\nNo disciplinary history.\n\nHighly respected by lecturers.\n\nNo known conflicts.\n\nHe frowned.\n\n\"Someone didn't choose her by chance.\"\n\n\"They chose her for a reason.\"\n\nMeanwhile...\n\nAriana returned to her hostel.\n\nShe stopped at the campus notice board.\n\nA fresh sheet of paper had been pinned there.\n\nStudents gathered around it.\n\nShe stepped closer.\n\nThe notice wasn't about the investigation.\n\nIt announced the names of students selected to represent Westbridge University at the\nNational Academic Excellence Conference.\n\nAt the very top...\n\nAriana Cole.\n\nMarcus smiled proudly.\n\n\"I knew you'd make it.\"\n\nLena hugged her.\n\n\"Congratulations!\"\n\nEthan grinned.\n\n\"You deserve it.\"\n\nChloe smiled warmly.\n\n\"I'm really happy for you.\"\n\nAriana looked at her friends.\n\n\"I almost forgot about the conference.\"\n\nMarcus laughed.\n\n\"Then we're reminding you.\"\n\n\"We're celebrating this weekend.\"\n\nAriana laughed softly.\n\n\"Only if everyone comes.\"\n\n\"We wouldn't miss it,\" Lena replied.\n\nThe five friends stood together, smiling.\n\nFor a brief moment...\n\nIt felt like the old days.\n\nBut across the courtyard...\n\nSomeone watched the celebration from a distance.\n\nTheir eyes rested on Ariana's name at the top of the notice board.\n\nThen slowly...\n\nTheir gaze shifted away.\n\nWithout a word...\n\nThey walked into the crowd and disappeared.\n\n💭 Ending Quote\n                 🌸\n\"Sometimes another person's success doesn't create envy... it awakens wounds that were never\nallowed to heal.\""
